    ns1:rationale "Exploration can enrich reuse descriptions and provenance if assumptions, limitations, source versions, model versions and analytical steps are recorded with the resulting resources. Communications can make discovery and reuse context available if findings are accompanied by accurate descriptions linked to the analytical resources." ;
