    ns1:rationale """Develop and Maintain the Enterprise Data Model (P) This will be the Enterprise Ontology and Knowledge Graph [source: DataArchitectureManagement!A3:F3] — Deliverable: Enterprise Data Model: Subject Area Model, Conceptual Model, Logical Model, Glossary.
Inferred support: the stated enterprise ontology/knowledge graph can implement shared formal representation, FAIR vocabulary use and qualified links. The deliverable also lists conceptual/logical models and a glossary, which alone do not establish these properties. No implementation evidence is supplied.""" ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DataArchitectureManagement!A3:L3" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "workbook_activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/I1> .

