    ns1:rationale """Design Data Integration Services (D)  [source: DataDevelopment!A9:F9] — Deliverable: Source-to-Target Maps, ETL Design Specs, Conversion Designs.
Explicit partial support for R1.2: source-to-target maps and ETL/conversion designs record transformation context. Inferred support for I3: those mappings can be expressed as typed references to identifiable source/target resources; design documents alone do not prove implementation. No implementation evidence is supplied.""" ;
