    ns1:rationale """Manage Data Model Versioning and Integration (C)  [source: DataDevelopment!A12:F12] — Deliverable: Model Management Libraries and Contents.
Explicit partial support: model management libraries and versioning can record the provenance of model artefacts if these are in the FAIR scope. Version records must be associated with released model data/metadata; versioning alone is incomplete provenance. No implementation evidence is supplied.""" ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DataModelingDesign!A12:L12" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "workbook_activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/R1.2> .

