    ns1:rationale """Establish Golden Records (C) [source: ReferenceMasterDataManagement!A7:F7] — Deliverable: Reliable Reference and Master Data,
Cross-Reference Data,
Data Lineage Reports,
Data Quality Reports.
Explicit partial support for R1.2: Data Lineage Reports can record origins and changes. Inferred support for I3: Cross-Reference Data can become typed references to identified resources; reliable golden records alone do not establish FAIRness. No implementation evidence is supplied.""" ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "ReferenceMasterDataManagement!A7:L7" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "workbook_activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/I3> .

