    ns1:rationale """Create and Maintain Metadata (O) [source: MetadataManagement!A6:F6] — Deliverable: Data Modelling Tools,
Database Management Systems,
Data Integration Tools,
Business Intelligence Tools,
System Management Tools,Database Management Systems
Object Modeling Tools,
Process Modeling Tools,
Report Generating Tools,
Data Quality Tools ,
Data Development and Administration Tools,
Reference and Master Data Management Tools.
Explicit partial support: creating and maintaining metadata supplies descriptions that can enable discovery and reuse. The deliverable is a tool list, so metadata richness and accuracy require record-level inspection. No implementation evidence is supplied.""" ;
