    ns1:sourcePosition 9 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Understand Enterprise Information Needs (P) \\[source: DataArchitectureManagement!A2:F2\\] — Deliverable: Lists of essential information requirements.; No clear FAIR support identified from the supplied activity and deliverable. This item can enable implementation, but it does not specify a defensible resource-level FAIR mechanism. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

