    ns1:sourceText "F4: Search the deployed index/catalogue using several attributes and confirm representative data/metadata records are registered and returned. Database tuning indexes and a repository without search do not establish F4.; Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable and its approval/maintenance records separately from the resource tests." .

