    ns1:fieldHeading "How they can support FAIR" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 9 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Maintained definitions and transformation records support rich discovery and reuse descriptions and provenance. A searchable service registry can support F4 where its entries identify the data or metadata resources accessible through services." .

