    ns1:rationale "Identify Reference Data Sources and Contributors (P) \\[source: ReferenceMasterDataManagement!A3:F3\\] — Deliverable: Description and Assessment of Sources and Contributors.; Explicit partial support: descriptions of sources and contributors capture origin and responsibility relevant to provenance; association with specific data/metadata and transformation history are still needed. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
