    ns1:rationale "Process Data for Business Intelligence (O) \\[source: DWandBIActivities!A6:F6\\] — Deliverable: Accessible Integrated Data, Data Quality Feedback Details.; Inferred support: Accessible Integrated Data can be exposed for retrieval if identified resources are served through a standard protocol; the deliverable does not specify this mechanism. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DWandBIActivities!A6:L6" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/A1> .

