    ns1:rationale "Provide Content Access and Retrieval (O) \\[source: DocumentContentManagement!A9:F9\\] — Deliverable: Portals, Content Analysis, Leveraged Information.; Inferred support: content access and retrieval can satisfy A1 if electronic content and metadata are retrieved by identifier via a standard protocol; the named portals do not establish this. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
