    ns1:rationale "Define and Maintain the Metadata Architecture (P)  \\[source: DataArchitectureManagement!A9:F9\\] — Deliverable: Metadata Architecture.; Inferred support: metadata architecture can select a shared formal representation; the source does not name the language or deployed records. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
