    ns4:alignmentBasis "Activity-derived proposal; source image plus interpreted associations"@en ;
    ns4:assessmentStatus "Proposed; no implementation or compliance asserted"@en ;
    ns4:deliverables "Data Analysis and Hypotheses"@en ;
    ns4:directSupportExplanation "Inferred potential direct support: documented hypotheses and methods can supply accurate, relevant methodological context for reusing the associated analytical data. The diagram does not establish that these descriptions are complete or associated with identifiable resources."@en ;
    ns4:evidenceRequirement "For R1, inspect resource-linked descriptions of hypotheses, methods, assumptions, units, scope and limitations, and verify their accuracy and relevance for reuse. For R1.2, additionally inspect input versions, methods, agents and execution history. An unexplained model or hypothesis list is insufficient."@en ;
    ns4:inTopic ns2:BigDataAndDataScience ;
    ns4:indirectSupportExplanation "Versioned methods and input records can enable provenance when linked to the resulting data and model outputs."@en ;
    ns4:lifecycleCode "D"@en ;
