    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the D2 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "More leadership members in the company have started to understand FAIR data and its value." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D2-L2 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-4c89d93b7cf4a916bdf4c88f .

ns1:evidence-0f12f1b5195d987d9e160261 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L140> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L140> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "Governance: recognize the need for governance processes related to FAIR principles and the processes for FAIR (e.g. master and reference data, consideration of dimensions for FAIR, RDMs )." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D5-L2 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-6eb4b137662ec9cd5ca1f221 .

ns1:evidence-182b0cb38eefea9f0eea7d5f a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L65> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L65> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "Data, conformed to a local model, is cataloged (i.e. a metadata record of existence is created), and data resides in a data lake." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D1-L2 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-58bc492081d70375669d2f9d .

ns1:evidence-2d529e9390b71648ab845672 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L140> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L140> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "The organization possesses comprehensive metadata and awareness of data specifics. Although not all data details are within a FAIR catalog, there's an insight into licenses, refresh cycles, lineage, rationale, intended usage, and business value. Process design ensures knowledge of these aspects, particularly in procurement, contributing to a more comprehensive understanding of data assets." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D5-L2 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-6eb4b137662ec9cd5ca1f221 .

ns1:evidence-39f79df7d473215c2a7572ff a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L66> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L66> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "One can find “FAIR” data in local environments such as a organization’s departments, divisions or functions." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D1-L3 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-7916e71608d980241cda8967 .

ns1:evidence-4786faf245219f0a9a694ce5 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L158> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L158> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "The organization initiates formal training for FAIR roles while a majority have embraced FAIR principles for major resources, backed by well-trained personnel capable of evaluating and implementing FAIR standards. At least one business unit actively employs FAIR processes in production, supported by documentation and training, with other FAIR initiatives underway and coordinated efforts recognized." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D5-L3 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-8dd94d33c75963d7d8c8c307 .

ns1:evidence-549d9856d8c0739ace02dcb0 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L88> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L88> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the D2 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "Leadership has a vision and plans to make the entire company aware of FAIR data, FAIR practices and their value." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D2-L3 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-928a1143210545387e04ed63 .

ns1:evidence-59ad702818c83c965ee9a789 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level1.md#L120> ;
    ns1:matchingPhrase "guidelines for creating FAIR data" ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level1.md#L120> ;
    ns1:sourceText "In recognizing FAIR data's potential (business) value, there are processes to consider and determine which data we should makeFAIR retrospectively. Efforts are underway to establish processes that provide guidelines for creating FAIR data, including the policy development for globally unique identifiers to enable the \"F\" principle." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D5-L1 .

ns1:evidence-6336c7b780f4d68050dd8da0 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L186> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L186> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "The process can start with external resources (people or tools) but needs to shift to internal resources (employees), rolling the tooling and infrastructure out, including training and support." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D7-L3 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-fa91e1b2adb72ab6f7730b3f .

ns1:evidence-814c46ef7c6aae959ebcb6fa a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L186> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L186> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the I1 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "An \"anchor/reference model\", or \"enterprise-wide data model\", is being built (cf. refer to the Strategy dimension). This model can also be a semantic model external to the organization but selected based on business needs and suitability." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D7-L3 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-51b4a5787af4c76faa4fdba4 .

ns1:evidence-834c76761e92b41a2c47e384 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L123> ;
    ns1:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    ns1:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L123> ;
    ns1:rationale "The named deliverable may address the D4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    ns1:sourceText "The same individual often has multiple hats, or can embody multiple personas. However, designated roles start to take shape in the company. Organisaitons begin to have designated FAIR-related roles: advertising for new positions and recognising explicitly the FAIRification work that some people have done implicitly (and often without recognition) in their previous roles." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D4-L2 ;
    ns1:supportsInterpretation ns1:interpretation-c9b19eb0329ae7df3cb9feed .

