    === "Interoperability"

        Tool(s) or infrastructure component(s) which contributes, enhances or enriches Interoperability.

        *   [Knowledge representation languages](https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Knowledge-representation-language)
            
        *   [Structured vocabularies](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Structured-vocabulary&autosubmit=on)
            
