ns1:D7-L3 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:Descriptor ;
    rdfs:label "FAIR Tools and Infrastructures at L3"@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "D7-L3" ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L186> ;
    rdfs:comment "Tools support established FAIR production and metadata management, with a shift towards making data FAIR from creation. Internal capacity, training, reference models and defined interaction mechanisms develop alongside approved resources and vendor selection for wider rollout."@en ;
    ns1:atLevel ns1:L3 ;
    ns1:evidenceStatus "not assessed" ;
    ns1:fullSourceBlock """Established processes for producing and managing FAIR data, with tools, either internally developed or available by vendors and other organizations, could be limited in terms of entities and the level of sophistication.

    Tools that help create FAIR Data and manage metadata collection templates and ontologies are available.

    Ways of working ensure data is made FAIR from the onset, working prospectively rather than retrospectively (i.e., compared to doing FAIRification work after data creation).

    The process can start with external resources (people or tools) but needs to shift to internal resources (employees), rolling the tooling and infrastructure out, including training and support.

    An "anchor/reference model", or "enterprise-wide data model", is being built (cf. refer to the Strategy dimension). This model can also be a semantic model external to the organization but selected based on business needs and suitability.

    There is a conceptual definition of Interaction mechanisms with FAIR data, although they are not yet machine-actionable, indicating a step towards making data more accessible and interoperable.

    The approval of Budget and capacity for delivery at scale, along with the launch of RFPs or similar and vendors are selected to put tooling and infrastructure in place for company-wide use.

    It becomes easier to make data FAIR company-wide, using the well-supported off-the-shelf tools than in the previous maturity level.

    **[(Back to the FAIR Matrix)](FAIRMaturityMatrix.md)**

    === "Findability"

        Tool(s) or infrastructure component which contributes, enhances or enriches Findability:

        *   [Identifier services](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Identifier-service&autosubmit=on)
            
        *   [Metadata schemas](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Metadata-schema&autosubmit=on)
            
        *   [https://fairtoolkit.pistoiaalliance.org/use-cases/prospective-fairification-of-data-on-the-edison-platform-roche/](https://fairtoolkit.pistoiaalliance.org/use-cases/prospective-fairification-of-data-on-the-edison-platform-roche/)
          

    === "Accessibility"

        Tool(s) or infrastructure component(s) which contributes, enhances or enriches Accessibility.

        *   [Communication protocols](https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Communication-protocol)
            
        *   [Authorization&AuthenticationServices](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Authentication-and-authorization-service&autosubmit=on)
            
        *   [Metadata preservation policy](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Metadata-preservation-policy&autosubmit=on)
      

    === "Interoperability"

        Tool(s) or infrastructure component(s) which contributes, enhances or enriches Interoperability.

        *   [Structured vocabularies](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Structured-vocabulary&autosubmit=on)
          

    

    === "Reusability"

        Tool(s) or infrastructure component(s) which contributes, enhances or enriches Reusability.

        *   [Data Usage License](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Data-usage-license&autosubmit=on)
            
        *   [Provenance Model](https://peta-pico.github.io/tapas/tapas.html?api=peta-pico/dsw-nanopub-api&op=/find_gofair_qualified_things_x&param_searchterm=%20&param_type=https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/Provenance-model&autosubmit=on)




![](images/new-pisto-logo-small.png)""" ;
